Que 1.  List 3 real-world scenarios where your favorite apps (like Zomato, WhatsApp, or Spotify) use local storage to improve user experience when there is no internet connection, and explain in 1-2 lines how local storage helps in each case.

Ans :-)  

Example:

1. WhatsApp

WhatsApp stores chats and media files locally on the device.
This allows users to read previous messages even when there is no internet connection.

2. Spotify

Spotify saves downloaded songs in local storage.
Users can listen to their favorite music offline without internet.

3. Zomato

Zomato caches recently viewed restaurants and menus locally.
Users can still view recent information even if the internet connection is lost.
